{"full":"hf:medoidai/GiveBackGPT","spaceId":"medoidai/GiveBackGPT","name":"GiveBackGPT","source":"huggingface","description":"Creators Power AI. We Power Creators.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":null,"topics":["docker","region:us"],"technologies":[],"likes":4,"created":"2025-05-29T20:19:43.000Z","updated":"2025-06-02T10:40:47.000Z","license":"mit","runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://medoidai-givebackgpt.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/medoidai/GiveBackGPT","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T10:02:44.452Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-13T10:02:44.452Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-13T10:02:44.452Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🤲","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An initiative to build a fair and sustainable AI ecosystem by identifying and crediting open-access creators whose work shows strong similarity to AI-generated content.","GiveBackGPT is an initiative dedicated to creating a fair and sustainable AI ecosystem. This novel process orchestrates the automatic identification and crediting of open-access content creators, whose work is essential in training generative AI models and keeping them relatable.","By leveraging standard web search to find and credit content similar to AI-generated responses, GiveBackGPT aims to recognize and reward creators in a simple, platform-agnostic, and streamlined way. Placing creator crediting at the inference level aligns with the value extraction point, removing barriers for small AI teams to innovate and discouraging monopoly data licensing deals."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/medoidai/GiveBackGPT/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"68f6cddaddcd789bf7e4895431b81e9af4fd56317083f869ff661adcf6e5a12f","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T10:59:49.061Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T10:02:44.535Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An initiative to build a fair and sustainable AI ecosystem by identifying and cre